# Skill source dumps. Both the raw text and its gzip are kept OFF
# the git repo — the uncompressed form was 18 GiB and even the
# gzipped form (3.3 GiB) exceeds GitHub's per-push + free-tier LFS
# quota. See RELEASE.md for how users opt into fetching them.
skills/*/source.txt
skills/*/source.txt.gz
